<title>USA: TCI Satellite to reschedule launch.</title>
<headline>TCI Satellite to reschedule launch.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc said Tuesday's scheduled launch of its high-powered TEMPO satellite was delayed due to a main battery problem and that a rescheduling decision about the launch will be made Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>The problem was detected during the early stages of the countdown when the power was turned on, the company said.</p>
</text>
